.TH TIMESHIFT-ON-DEMAND 1 "August 2026" "timeshift-on-demand" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
timeshift-on-demand \- on-demand backup companion for Timeshift
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B timeshift-on-demand
.SH DESCRIPTION
Launches the Timeshift On Demand GTK3 companion app: Dashboard, Backup,
Settings, and Maintenance tabs built on top of the official
.BR timeshift (8)
package. Triggers on-demand backups with live in-app progress, shows a
read-only snapshot/status glance, and offers a cron-integrity watchdog
for Timeshift's own scheduling.
.PP
Snapshot browsing, restore, and deletion remain Timeshift's own
responsibility \(em use the "Open Timeshift" button in the app, or run
.B timeshift-launcher
directly.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/timeshift-on-demand/config.json
Per-user settings (currently just the configured backup drive UUID).
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/timeshift-on-demand/backup.log
Backup run history, shared with
.BR timeshift-on-demand-prompt (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR timeshift (8),
.BR timeshift-on-demand-prompt (1)
